    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "用语音和编程安排动作",
        "en": "Voice commands and action sequences"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/X1/6f4d450d1827.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "X1支持语音指令与编程动作，基本移动包括前进、后退、左右转向和停止。可以先熟悉单个动作，再把几种动作排成一段表演。",
        "en": "X1 supports voice commands and programmable actions. Basic movement includes forward, reverse, turns and stop. Learn individual actions before combining them into a short sequence."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "从握手到翻身、倒立",
        "en": "From handshakes to stunt moves"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/X1/59455217a7fc.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "动作清单列有握手、坐下、趴下、翻身、俯卧撑、倒立与功夫动作，也有跳舞、学习和歌曲内容。操作时可按动作类型逐项尝试，给肢体活动留出空间。",
        "en": "The action list includes handshakes, sitting, lying down, rolling over, push-ups, handstands and kung fu moves, along with dancing, learning activities and songs. Leave room around the dog for its movements."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
